  "post_content": "<p>Las fiestas del barrio Cam&iacute; Castell&oacute; i adjacents de Onda han llegado a su ecuador con una nueva tarde taurina, con un ejemplar de Santi Domecq, soltado desde debajo de la hornacina de Sant Josepet, algunos capones, que han dado bastantes juego y un peque&ntilde;o susto a un mozo, y algunas vacas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimecresbousbarricastello/img_9690.jpg\" alt=\"img_9690\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimecresbousbarricastello/img_9691.jpg\" alt=\"img_9691\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimecresbousbarricastello/img_9692.jpg\" alt=\"img_9692\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimecresbousbarricastello/img_9693.jpg\" alt=\"img_9693\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimecresbousbarricastello/img_9694.jpg\" alt=\"img_9694\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimecresbousbarricastello/img_9695.jpg\" alt=\"img_9695\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimecresbousbarricastello/img_9696.jpg\" alt=\"img_9696\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimecresbousbarricastello/img_9697.jpg\" alt=\"img_9697\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimecresbousbarricastello/img_9698.jpg\" alt=\"img_9698\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimecresbousbarricastello/img_9699.jpg\" alt=\"img_9699\" style=\"